#: price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Set role-based product prices in WooCommerce. Apply global multipliers or "
"fixed per-product prices per role. Upgrade to Pro for rules, quantity "
"discounts, adjustment types, and more."
msgstr ""
"Indstil rollebaserede produktpriser i WooCommerce. Anvend generelle "
"multiplikatorer eller faste priser pr. produkt for hver rolle. Opgrader til "
"Pro for at få adgang til regler, mængderabatter, justeringstyper og meget "
"mere."

